<!-- The panel menu (F1.0 behavior 4): Dock's tool chrome menu with Move to left, right and bottom added, and without
     "Dock as tabbed document" (a panel never takes the map's place). Defined under Dock's own key, so Dock's controls
     use it. The Float, Dock, Auto hide and Close items are copied from Dock's Fluent theme
     (https://github.com/wieslawsoltes/Dock, src/Dock.Avalonia.Themes.Fluent/Controls/ToolChromeControl.axaml, MIT
     licence), version 12.1.0.9; check them when Dock is updated. Dock's licence, for the copied items:

     The MIT License (MIT)

